      "parameters": {
        "mode": "retrieve-as-tool",
        "toolDescription": "Searches mortgage lending guidance and lender overlays stored in the Supabase vector database. It performs a semantic similarity search using the user's query and returns relevant text chunks along with metadata.\n\nEach returned result includes:\n- `content` → the actual snippet from the guideline\n- `source` → e.g., FHA, VA, UWM, Fannie\n- `doc_type` → agency or overlay\n- `version_date` → when the document was last updated\n\nUse this tool for all factual queries about loan eligibility, DTI, credit score rules, income documentation, property types, appraisal requirements, and other mortgage-specific criteria.\n\nAlways pass the user’s question as the query and return 3–5 top results. Prioritize overlay matches (e.g., UWM) first if the question relates to lender-specific policies.\n",
        "tableName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "documents",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "documents"
        },
        "options": {}
